<title>CANADA: Rand A Technology proposes stock split.</title>
<headline>Rand A Technology proposes stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MISSISSAUGA, Ontario 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rand A Technology Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors approved in principle a two-for-one stock split of Rand A's outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>Rand A said shareholders would vote on the stock split at a special shareholders meeting on December 2.</p>
<p>The proposed split would increase the number of common shares outstanding to 14.8 million from 7.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
